                                                "sense_id": "391bb878-95a0-3c13-9135-12db9148b12f",
                                                "text": "But when a king sets himself to bandy against the highest court and residence of all his regal power, he then […] fights against his own majesty and kingship."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "54710dc3-c34b-322e-97b7-4d54485368c0",
